meta {
  name: Generate Field Parsers
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/templates/1/field-parsers/generate
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Parser generation is accepted only when the template has been classified as a
  transaction alert. Unclassified templates and templates classified as non-alerts
  return `409 Conflict`:

  ```json
  {"detail":"Template is not classified as a transaction alert"}
  ```

  The 202 response contains a job URL. When the job succeeds, a validated parser
  draft is saved and awaits review. GET Field Parsers includes session ID, round,
  and status. Send feedback with the Correct Field Parsers request, or approve the
  draft. A new generation without feedback supersedes the previous session.
}
